title: 24-Hour Clock Persistence & Door Ajar Chime
raw_community_title: ⚡ [Lightning] 24-Hour Clock Persistence & Door Ajar Chime
category: Cluster and Displays
platform: F-150 Lightning
model_years: 2022-2026
trim: All
source_sheet: 2021-2026 F150.xlsx
notes: '[Category: Cluster and Displays] [Years: 2022-2026] [Original Title: 24-Hour
  Clock Persistence / Disable Door Ajar Chime]

  Configures 24-hour clock persistence and door ajar chime. Note: for startup seat
  belt chime, European strategy sets IPC 720-01-02 byte to wait until in motion.'
steps:
- module: IPC
  address: 720-01-02
  targets:
  - mask: xx*x xxxx xx--
    type: discrete
    bits:
    - bit: 2
      action: 1
      feature_name: Global Clock 12 or 24 (GC)
      target_state: GC 24 hour display
    - bit: 1
      action: 0
      feature_name: Engine/Ignition On Chime - Message (EIOCM)
      target_state: EIOCM Disabled
    - bit: 0
      action: 0
      feature_name: Engine/Ignition On Chime - Message (EIOCM)
      target_state: EIOCM Disabled
recipe_version: '1.1'
